sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Parser as Parser (LLM)
    participant Embed as Embedding (LLM)
    participant FAISS as FAISS IndexFlatIP
    participant Filters as Filters
    participant Judge as Judge (LLM, optional)
    participant MMR as MMR Diversity

    Client->>API: POST /search {query, limit, use_judge}
    API->>Parser: parse_query(query)
    Parser-->>API: facets (JSON)
    API->>Embed: embed_query(query)
    Embed-->>API: vector (unit-norm)
    API->>FAISS: search(vector)
    FAISS-->>API: top row ids
    API->>API: retriever join ids->products
    API->>Filters: apply budget/category/gender/constraints
    Filters-->>API: kept candidates
    alt use_judge==true
        API->>Judge: judge_batch(cands[:M])
        Judge-->>API: scores + rationale
        API->>API: blend with retrieval (alpha)
    else
        API->>API: skip judge (fallback to retrieval-only)
    end
    API->>MMR: select final K (lambda)
    MMR-->>API: diversified items
    API-->>Client: 200 {items, trace.timings}

    Note over Parser,MMR: Typical latencies: parse ~150-300ms, embed ~30-60ms, FAISS ~1-5ms, judge dominates if enabled
